  "label": "User projected onto the nerdy_computer_user scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual entity 'man' (nerdy_computer_user) as the person who 'maxes out intelligence and puts nothing on agility'. This projection is implied through the self-deprecating humor of the meme, where the viewer is invited to identify with the stereotypical 'nerdy' figure as a representation of themselves, especially in contexts where they perceive their intellectual strengths contrast with physical limitations. The text 'when you max out intelligence...' directly addresses the user ('you'), creating an implicit deictic projection onto the visual material.",
